# The core's point.

[break] a-change-of-level-has-no-point-before-its-engine-is-in-force
rule: A change of level waits at an awaited point after making its engine and writing its lease, before it puts the engine in force.
file: crates/cortex-core/src/core.rs
in: Core::set_level
find: cortex_base::hook::await_point!(crate::policy::BEFORE_THE_NEW_LEVEL_IS_IN_FORCE);
replace:
caught-by:
    cortex-core::it redecide::a_revoke_made_while_the_level_changes_is_not_lost

# `cortex-policy`'s `TestParts`.

[break] test-parts-home-is-not-the-resolvers
rule: The default resolver of a test's parts reads `~` as the home directory the parts end with.
file: crates/cortex-policy/src/test_support.rs
in: TestParts::parts
find: home: parts.home.clone()
replace: home: None
caught-by:
    test_support::tests::the_home_directory_is_the_one_the_default_resolver_reads_tilde_as

[break] test-parts-ignore-a-given-resolver
rule: A resolver a test gives is the one its engine uses, in place of reading paths as text.
